{"id":"578d0274-1a5c-4f2f-88bd-1cb7757c1bf3","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"efbaebccacb07e36","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"ef1ea203cae6f396ea0524745e4a16234f33ac87","start":974,"end":1046},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","serving","=","runner",".","runs",".","runningService","(","(","run",")","=>","run",".","cwd","===","ctx",".","cwd",")"]},"context":{"before":"71be9986199e9150#0","after":"0941eb55b2b79a83"}},"payload":{"text":"One dev server per directory: a second `vite` here would only start a copy on the next port. Say where the first is.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:11.972Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:11.972Z"}
{"id":"63941635-b542-4d70-81b0-abb95f37dafe","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a5d4ecfbda10265e","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"18445e0df5859d39cc78766ff0e5a94707996ffd","start":2156,"end":2242},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","say","=","(","text",":","string",")",":","void","=>","{","writeLive","(","\"","out","\"",",","text",")",";","run",".","say","(","text",")",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"94968c8dfdffc974","after":"ed35927db619d262"}},"payload":{"text":"To its terminal, and to whoever's following the run (preview-session.ts).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:08.742Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:08.742Z"}
{"id":"73311d7d-9123-40e3-b608-b88180ced2c4","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"200db1fcb2a98b78","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"6af48eac43006d23d9f98c71f1fc08daad6c1002","start":2508,"end":2824},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","restart","=","async","(",")",":","Promise","<","void",">","=>","{","restarting","=","true",";","say","(","`","  ","${","stamp","(",")","}"," [vite] restarting\\n","\\","n","`",")",";","await","runner",".","stopDevServer","(","port",")",";","await","start","(",")",".","catch","(","(","error",":","unknown",")","=>","{","say","(","`","vite: ","${","error","instanceof","Error","?","error",".","message",":","String","(","error",")","}","\\","\\n","n","`",")",";","stop","(",")",";","}",")",";","restarting","=","false",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"ed35927db619d262","after":"b75da0f3cfe1531c"}},"payload":{"text":"Started over: the same run, on the same port, its windows closing as the old server goes and a window opening on the new.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:07.656Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:07.656Z"}
{"id":"915b04e7-02a6-4809-8aef-48a4e4a7fcb3","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3a18ab94623615fe","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"1da5fee46243eb8aa619a107f8d8abbd040a77f7","start":445,"end":467},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","BASE_PORT","=","5173"]},"context":{"before":"0fe3726b1ac55994","after":"293807adbff23ea4"}},"payload":{"text":"The first port. Concurrent `vite`s each claim the next free one, so their addresses and hot updates never collide.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:13.052Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:13.052Z"}
{"id":"9de964ca-6a26-4163-a7b1-eb883095cf08","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0fe3726b1ac55994","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"eaaa2ded144894668ac5aedd9b92fcfb245eb3c2","start":0,"end":57},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","CommandHost",",","Handler","}","from","\"","../../catalog","\""]},"context":{"after":"3a18ab94623615fe"}},"payload":{"text":"The terminal's `vite`: starts almostnode's dev server in the dev-server worker (real Vite can't run in a browser), says\nits address, which opens a preview window, and blocks like a real dev server, streaming its hot updates, until Ctrl-C,\nthe running list's Stop or its last window closing. A\nproject's `\"dev\": \"vite\"` maps here, so `npm run dev` composes onto it.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:14.189Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:14.189Z"}
{"id":"fc9dc177-cd37-4579-b4ef-40787c85b423","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"263a5db5619efe60","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workbench/terminal/commands/vite/vite.ts","baseline":{"blob":"202c560bbe8d13eb963ca7038e12db23a0c5cee8","start":1515,"end":1623},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","event","=","Object",".","fromEntries","(","ctx",".","env",")","[","\"","npm_lifecycle_event","\"","]","??","ctx",".","exportedEnv","?.","[","\"","npm_lifecycle_event","\"","]"]},"context":{"before":"bd16e1059d3200ae","after":"3ced32ff95461466"}},"payload":{"text":"(`npm run` passes the script's name in the environment it runs it with: ctx.env, not the exported one)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:09.873Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:06:09.873Z"}
